{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;They say the world is going to end this year.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But to me, that's not important at all.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this lonely, empty room, all I have are my delusions.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...This might be my last chance. To create <i>something that matters.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/1b8daad5bc537610cccd2c963b738451.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story in the works for 10 years.\u00a0Shape queer love and friendship at the end of the world in this choice-driven, emotional narrative game. Will you settle for pessimism, or open yourself to trust?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doce Fim stars a <strong>pessimistic, depressed protagonist</strong> who had shut himself in his room, refusing to see or interact with the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His last chance appears as a <strong>writing contest</strong> at a local university, where he meets two creative writing students <strong>investigating the end of the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little does he know that their eccentric club might just be the <strong>safe place</strong> that harbors the connections he\u2019s always longed for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where <strong>love</strong>, both platonic and romantic, can blossom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about connection, humanity, and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story about us.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/4d365ddddeaf0877035f6b251e9fbdcd.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1600 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/9c75a18042d6e78d191c80be05dcb627.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/1e0fbbd8d74f16a1a383976b2457d054.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/0ed078207a21154530c65793bf17220b.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/d1a321c124fb9f230aae5be1135354dc.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/37226da0270b7271730756c05a830e2d.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/733b930005c058208a05a1143d3165bd.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0xxxxxxx</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/a3414be43752c234a80601f5a8054704.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >General Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 300k words \u2013 </strong>almost 30 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Four unique routes, one romantic and two platonic, and the True Route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Each route has a good and bad ending, unlocked based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Accessibility options including audio descriptions, self-voicing, changing text font and size, turning off specific audio, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/duality.png?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duality Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A choice system where the protagonist's two sides - the positive and the negative - suggest possible actions that you can pick from.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But<i> be carefu</i>l, as from negativity comes distrust, and from positivity comes naivety. Moreover, personal bias from each side might impact your options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/clsIIj.gif?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRUST System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices increase or decrease TRUST with each character. High trust unlocks unique bonding conversations, while low trust might lead to a bad ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/JNlK3g.gif?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paranoia Bubbles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubbles that shake, pop, dissolve and cover your vision of reality, representing the protagonist's paranoid and anxious thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing a route, the related character's\u00a0bubbles are updated to reflect what they were <i>really </i>thinking in key moments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/qHzqIz-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Camerawork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive cinematic camera that zooms in and out, moves, rotates, and follows the protagonist's vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/f1.png?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Artwork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Gorgeous sprites</strong> with\u00a0 over 100 expression variations each;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 20 fully-rendered <strong>CGs</strong>;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Additional artwork</strong> such as chibis, fullbody art, cut-ins, and pixel art illustrations by guest artists;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>3 original backgrounds</strong>, hopefully more depending on how support goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808270?t=1771689629","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808270?t=1771689629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/44ddedb8f3685f8d0c85abc77ab68c3deeb225a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771689629","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/44ddedb8f3685f8d0c85abc77ab68c3deeb225a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771689629","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The characters have a drinking contest, smoke tobacco, and talk about smoking recreational weed. \r\nConversations about suicide, self-harm and suicidal ideation occur, but it's not depicted graphically or described in-depth. Characters make innuendos and sexually charged jokes. There are nightmare scenes that describe violent bullying and show blood.\r\n\r\nAll characters in university and 20 years or older."},"demos":[{"appid":3810270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;They say the world is going to end this year.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But to me, that's not important at all.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this lonely, empty room, all I have are my delusions.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...This might be my last chance. To create <i>something that matters.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/1b8daad5bc537610cccd2c963b738451.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story in the works for 10 years.\u00a0Shape queer love and friendship at the end of the world in this choice-driven, emotional narrative game. Will you settle for pessimism, or open yourself to trust?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doce Fim stars a <strong>pessimistic, depressed protagonist</strong> who had shut himself in his room, refusing to see or interact with the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His last chance appears as a <strong>writing contest</strong> at a local university, where he meets two creative writing students <strong>investigating the end of the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little does he know that their eccentric club might just be the <strong>safe place</strong> that harbors the connections he\u2019s always longed for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where <strong>love</strong>, both platonic and romantic, can blossom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about connection, humanity, and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story about us.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/4d365ddddeaf0877035f6b251e9fbdcd.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1600 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/9c75a18042d6e78d191c80be05dcb627.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/1e0fbbd8d74f16a1a383976b2457d054.avif?t=1771689629\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/0ed078207a21154530c65793bf17220b.avif?t=17