rning off specific audio, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/duality.png?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duality Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A choice system where the protagonist's two sides - the positive and the negative - suggest possible actions that you can pick from.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But<i> be carefu</i>l, as from negativity comes distrust, and from positivity comes naivety. Moreover, personal bias from each side might impact your options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/clsIIj.gif?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRUST System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices increase or decrease TRUST with each character. High trust unlocks unique bonding conversations, while low trust might lead to a bad ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/JNlK3g.gif?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paranoia Bubbles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubbles that shake, pop, dissolve and cover your vision of reality, representing the protagonist's paranoid and anxious thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing a route, the related character's\u00a0bubbles are updated to reflect what they were <i>really </i>thinking in key moments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/qHzqIz-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Camerawork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive cinematic camera that zooms in and out, moves, rotates, and follows the protagonist's vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/extras/f1.png?t=1771689629\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Artwork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Gorgeous sprites</strong> with\u00a0 over 100 expression variations each;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 20 fully-rendered <strong>CGs</strong>;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Additional artwork</strong> such as chibis, fullbody art, cut-ins, and pixel art illustrations by guest artists;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>3 original backgrounds</strong>, hopefully more depending on how support goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Meiri Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808270/c43f73ffb2111950f0a27e37cc689d61905e21d6/header.jpg?t=1771689629","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3808270/1744313195/2b8c31fdbed37cd431649618146ae02c9d18e7db/1761679619/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761936044","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3808270/1744313195/2b8c31fdbed37cd4316